{
  "name": "Score inbound leads with Google Gemini and alert on hot leads",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ecf116a8-64b4-4384-937a-f2e4f5f5fe72",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -980,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 874,
        "content": "## Score inbound leads with Google Gemini and alert on hot leads\n\n### Who is this for\nSmall sales teams, agencies and freelancers who get more form submissions than they can read quickly, and want the serious ones flagged the moment they land.\n\n### What this workflow does\nA webhook receives each lead as JSON. Google Gemini scores it from 0 to 10 on purchase intent and fit, with a one-line reason. Leads at or above your threshold are sent straight to a webhook of your choice with the score, reason and original lead attached. Everything else goes down a cold branch you can connect to a sheet or CRM.\n\n### How to set up\n1. Get a free Gemini API key from Google AI Studio.\n2. Create a Query Auth credential with name `key` and your API key as the value, then select it on the Gemini node.\n3. In **Configure (edit me)**, set the hot-lead webhook URL and the score threshold (default 7).\n4. Activate the workflow and point your form at its production webhook URL.\n\n### Requirements\n- A Google Gemini API key (the free tier is enough)\n- A form, CRM or app that can POST JSON to a webhook\n- A webhook for hot-lead alerts\n\n### How to customize\nDescribe your ideal customer in the scoring prompt; specific criteria give better scores. Raise or lower the threshold to control alert volume.\n\nMore ready-made AI workflows: https://ruancody.gumroad.com/l/vlbne"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "24f9e512-c311-439f-ade4-55254f8d2c59",
      "name": "Section score",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -440,
        -180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 600,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## Receive and score\nThe lead comes in, your settings load, and Gemini scores it."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "4f79652a-d409-4687-948a-8b1d05f9b2f3",
      "name": "Section route",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        220,
        -180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## Route\nParse the score, then send hot leads on and mark cold ones."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger-1",
      "name": "Lead Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [
        -400,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "lead-qualifier-webhook",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "lead-qualifier",
        "options": {},
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "onReceived"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "config-1",
      "name": "Configure (edit me)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        -180,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "hotLeadWebhookUrl",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://webhook.site/REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_DESTINATION"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "qualifyThreshold",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-qualify-1",
      "name": "AI Qualify Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "maxTries": 5,
      "position": [
        40,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-3.6-flash:generateContent",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ contents: [ { parts: [ { text: \"You are a sales lead qualifier. Score this lead submission from 0-10 on purchase intent and fit, and give a one-sentence reason. Respond ONLY as JSON: {\\\"score\\\": number, \\\"reason\\\": string}. Lead data:\\n\" + JSON.stringify($('Lead Webhook').item.json.body) } ] } ] }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpQueryAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpQueryAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Gemini API Key"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "parse-1",
      "name": "Parse AI Score",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b1",
              "name": "aiResult",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text.replace(/```json\\n?|```/g, '')) }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "if-1",
      "name": "Hot Lead?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-1",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.aiResult.score }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Configure (edit me)').item.json.qualifyThreshold }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "notify-hot-1",
      "name": "Notify Hot Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        700,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Configure (edit me)').item.json.hotLeadWebhookUrl }}",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ alert: 'Hot lead', score: $json.aiResult.score, reason: $json.aiResult.reason, lead: $('Lead Webhook').item.json.body }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json"
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "log-cold-1",
      "name": "Log Cold Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        700,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "name": "loggedAs",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "cold-lead"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    }
  ],
